class=\"source-question-number\">33</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c11-t2-l-q33\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></p><p>The design is based on the concept of a mystery</p><p><strong>Building design</strong></p><p>It’s approached by a <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">34</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c11-t2-l-q34\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span>&nbsp;for pedestrians</p><p>The building is the shape of a <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">35</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c11-t2-l-q35\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></p><p>One exterior wall acts as a large <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">36</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c11-t2-l-q36\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></p><p>In the auditorium:</p><ul><li>the floor is built on huge pads made of <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">37</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c11-t2-l-q37\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></li><li>the walls are made of local wood and are <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">38</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c11-t2-l-q38\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span>&nbsp;in shape</li><li>ceiling panels and <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">39</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c11-t2-l-q39\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span>&nbsp;on walls allow adjustment of acoustics</li></ul><p><strong>Evaluation</strong></p><p>Some critics say the <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">40</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c11-t2-l-q40\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span>&nbsp;style of the building is inappropriate</p></div></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":10}],"audio_fallbacks":["https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/cambridge-ielts-11-academic-listening-2-audio-4.mp3"],"order_index":4}],"questions":[{"id":"en-c11-t2-l-q1","part_id":"en-c11-t2-l-p1","group_id":"en-c11-t2-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","question_text":"","correct_answer":"hostel","correct_answer_variants":["hostel"],"answerCount":1,"sourceNumbers":[1],"sourceInputName":"ielts_listening_answer_12011_1","order_index":1,"points":1},{"id":"en-c11-t2-l-q2","part_id":"en-c11-t2-l-p1","group_id":"en-c11-t2-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","question_text":"","correct_answer":"Buckleigh","correct_answer_variants":["Buckleigh"],"answerCount":1,"sourceNumbers":[2],"sourceInputName":"ielts_listening_answer_12011_2","order_index":2,"points":1},{"id":"en-c11-t2-l-q3","part_id":"en-c11-t2-l-p1","group_id":"en-c11-t2-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","question_text":"","correct_answer":"PE9 7QT","correct_answer_variants":["PE9 7QT"],"answerCount":1,"sourceNumbers":[3],"sourceInputName":"ielts_listening_answer_12011_3","order_index":3,"points":1},{"id":"en-c11-t2-l-q4","part_id":"en-c11-t2-l-p1","group_id":"en-c11-t2-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","question_text":"","correct_answer":"waiter","correct_answer_variants":["waiter"],"answerCount":1,"sourceNumbers":[4],"sourceInputName":"ielts_listening_answer_12011_4","order_index":4,"points":1},{"id":"en-c11-t2-l-q5","part_id":"en-c11-t2-l-p1","group_id":"en-c11-t2-l-g1-0